# Playwright's own run output (actual/diff images, traces, HTML report), and the baseline PNGs
# `toHaveScreenshot()` diffs against: none of these binary images live on `master`, on purpose,
# the same reason PR-run screenshots live on the orphan `visual-snapshots` branch instead of a
# regular commit (see architecture.md's "Visual regression and PR screenshots"). Baselines live
# on their own orphan `visual-baselines` branch instead, fetched into these same paths before a
# test run and pushed back only when a maintainer explicitly accepts a visual change.
test-results/
playwright-report/
e2e/**/*-snapshots/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.local
